/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
  species/Male.dat -- ONE model species, ONE typed file: the doubly charged anion of maleic acid.

  NO `aqueousThermo` ON PURPOSE.  The ionisation (pK, dH, dCp) of maleic acid is evaluated in
  Goldberg, Kishore & Lennen, J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 31 (2002) 231, Table 7.42 (Maleate), p. 305, and is in chemistry/ -- so the SPECIATION (pH, distribution) is complete.  No work
  in hand prints a formation enthalpy or entropy of this aqueous ion, so a balance that needs its
  enthalpy REFUSES BY NAME instead of borrowing a value.
\*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
recordType modelSpecies;
schemaVersion 1;

name    Male;
formula     "C4H2O4-2";
charge  -2;
MW { value 114.056; unit g/mol;}
